{title: Saat Samundar Paar Mai Tere}
{artist: Sadhana Sargam}
{key: G#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#m] [F#],        Saat samundar paar main tere
[D#m] [G#m],        peechhe peechhe aa gai
[G#m],        zulmi meri jaan ...
[G#m] [F#],        o zulmi meri jaan tere
[E] [F#],        kadamon ke neeche aa gai
[G#m],        saat samundar....
[G#m] [F#],        Na rasta maaloom na
[F#] [G#m],        tera maan-pata maaloom
[F#],        kaise mere pyaar ne tujhako
[G#m],        dhoondha kya maaloom
[G#m],        seedhi tere paas ...
[G#m] [F#],        seedhi tere paas main
[E] [F#],        ankhiyaan meeche meeche a gai
[G#m],        saat samundar....
[G#m] [F#],        Mainne teri yaadon ke
[F#] [G#m],        zulfon mein lagaaye phool
[F#],        aage teri marzi tu kar
[G#m],        na kar mujhe kabool
[G#m],        chhod ke main apane
[G#m] [F#],        chhod ke main apane
[E] [F#],        baabal ke baag-bageeche a gai
[G#m],        saat samundar....
